<metadata><name>Galičica trail T-7</name><desc>T-7 is one of Galičica National Park's harder and longer hiking trails, with more climbing. It runs 4.5 km from the MTB-6 junction to the Galičica pass road, climbing about 531 m and descending 0 m in the direction drawn, between 1,029 m and 1,563 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/t-7/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
